From a5b33410f98454469c66c3fdc83413409328698f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daedalao <daedalao@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 21:19:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/15] linux/ppc: register 32-bit atomic intrinsics; fix
 big-endian memHash64

internal/runtime/maps: on big-endian 32-bit targets memHash64Fallback
mixed the halves of the key in the opposite order from memHashFallback,
so the two hash paths disagreed (TestMemHash64Equality). Also add ppc to
the gcinfo test table and the asmdecl vet arch list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0117Su2urNmg96oYM6vhHi1y
